WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.009 --> 00:00:18.510
Humans kill at least 100 million sharks a
year, or about 11,000 an hour.

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:25.070
If everyone in the world washed their hands
properly, a million lives could be saved a

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:26.380
year.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:33.160
The Pentagon has actually created an emergency
plan in case of a zombie attack.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:39.809
Steve Jobs held important business meetings
whilst walking, because our brains work better

00:00:39.809 --> 00:00:42.039
whilst the body is physically active.

00:00:42.039 --> 00:00:51.639
A Blackpool hotel charged a couple a £100
fine after they wrote a TripAdvisor review

00:00:51.639 --> 00:00:57.829
describing it as a "dirty, rotten stinking
hovel run by muppets."

00:00:57.829 --> 00:01:04.489
Queen Elizabeth II of England owns a drive-through
McDonald's as part of her enormous property

00:01:04.489 --> 00:01:06.310
portfolio.

00:01:06.310 --> 00:01:12.580
To help panda cubs adapt to living in the
wild, researchers at a panda centre in China

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:16.850
wear panda costumes whilst working with them.

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:23.390
Male kangaroos are known to flex their biceps
to impress female kangaroos.

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:31.450
Most bees buzz in the key of A, unless they
are tired, when they buzz in the key of E.

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:41.670
In 2011, a woman bought a non-visible piece
of art for $10,000, entitled "Fresh Air".

00:01:41.670 --> 00:01:48.520
Mr. Kanso is a popular Japanese restaurant
that only serves tinned food.

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:54.421
Diners get to select their meal from a huge
variety of tinned food from the shelves.

00:01:54.421 --> 00:02:00.980
A woman who survived a plane bomb explosion
in 1972 was awarded the Guinness World Record

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:08.440
title for the highest fall without a parachute
at 33,000 feet.

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:17.780
Women buy 85% of the world's Valentine cards
and 96% of all the candles in America.

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:22.680
Panda eat bamboo for at least 12 hours a day.

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:30.010
The Indonesian volcano Kawah Ijen produces
blue flames from its lava because of its high

00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:31.579
sulphur content.

00:02:31.579 --> 00:02:39.329
A single human male produces enough sperm
in a fortnight to impregnate every fertile

00:02:39.329 --> 00:02:44.209
woman on the planet.

